      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Watch the evolution loop for corruption. Deterministic in what it flags; never\nauthoritative in what it concludes.",
      "sha256": "7f5da950c21f4de6b6b8fa72d91abe33abc489eafc0df5eee7878e5c02635941",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "paragraph[4]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Triggers",
      "sha256": "e62f2148a64d96bbe686416d73a233e656bf7e9fb9c2160598b525f6a99c8de6",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[18]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0005",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "An evolution cycle has run (S → G → Q → P → V) and its trace/proposal needs scanning",
      "sha256": "bee207010c6d62a3bb6495b05340d6131e7d3aa8ceadc2926e9abc8ee53d2034",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[20]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0004",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0006",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "H asks \"check this for corruption\", \"watch this cycle\", \"L-scan this\"",
      "sha256": "fd8a4e7e4b6377b2b3845b9ccf53015eaf9002e91998822efb22752a456b1996",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[21]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0004",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0007",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "A promotion diff or evidence set is presented for review",
      "sha256": "97f1e85e2a3bcc3b5b2b3006ee2e80b70adbe2dba636b433087315864845cb65",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[22]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0004",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0008",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "The self-evolution orchestrator invokes this skill post-cycle (line 9: L1 L2 L3 L4 V∅)",
      "sha256": "06e66940eb131befb8bab8e5ea1a6f63323c88a332d3813cec97b7e19f670842",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[23]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0004",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Non-Triggers",
      "sha256": "7fc141dd409c38469ad78f3dd33c051b5c25677ed9fd14bb8410bee50355b107",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[25]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0010",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Certifying, validating, or blessing any trace as \"clean 5QLN\" (L3 — false authority)",
      "sha256": "91077e081015a8a248026979ed3d2d4ba3ca89b48552118e9dceb422cf6a5f61",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[27]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0009",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0011",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Originating the next question, judging resonance, or naming Z",
      "sha256": "bfc900a13246b2783fedb8a8895c1b4c65052eea28effa17aec9fecd1b0eb529",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[28]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0009",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0012",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Editing the kernel, the seal, or any invariant",
      "sha256": "603b799f8576a21bd23cca6d8dcc870180f4c4897897181e6aeeeaef0dd9ae5f",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[29]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0009",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0013",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Silently passing a trace because it *looks* compliant",
      "sha256": "8296c6e3883ea4f3e90dba34d3a64a65c90551ef1b0e0eeaff0c06a95bfd46f1",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[30]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0009",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Authority Boundary",
      "sha256": "24af7a1191ffeed8618a275b8e51098aa9463aba865e99f4e5c21ab3d518f4e4",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[32]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The watcher CAN:",
      "sha256": "b29f60d2007ea64c569f465d90ae557a04b212018a2e3b316013608675d96cd9",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "paragraph[21]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0016",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Scan a trace, proposal, or evidence set for the five corruption codes",
      "sha256": "8e713cb5c0c692797e7de6100055ee487371dab7d4315b58a63adb1bbf729769",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[36]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0017",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Report findings as a structured scan result (codes, phase anchors, quotes)",
      "sha256": "bcd42419db6000a11539096ba31c731dc458b3bde34c05fce8094724865f2b09",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[37]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0018",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Verify the kernel seal (sha256 of kernel.txt == feaa46b4…859b) before scanning",
      "sha256": "3dbd17e62f178bd8bbc0f793b1435d3e6d15d96456b0ec012c576bab406e2d3f",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[38]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0019",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Flag provenance gaps (spark not H-verbatim, evidence not digest-scoped)",
      "sha256": "649632ee5adca4977b90775228ec047c00f638f84601f354c2e029baf7a27734",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[39]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The watcher CANNOT:",
      "sha256": "889b9de5ec4f8e42e4a9d19d9b406e80acbcbe7f7831c03c68d6c8d8380584de",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "paragraph[27]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0021",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Say a trace is \"good\", \"living\", or \"certified\" — only \"no corruption code detected\"",
      "sha256": "d26670bd0bcfcde133636b0eee1e0c0af4c991fd279742e94180556b1dccca94",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[43]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0022",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Originate a spark, a review finding, or a return question",
      "sha256": "65b985532c0cc4069907f872cfd6bccc428ce972eefffec872efa821f0ea3b87",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[44]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0023",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Relax a detection rule because the cycle felt resonant",
      "sha256": "295cccbc9db769d86350c29e822ec874fa5223e76b75f95fe373b2b729ee16b6",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[45]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0014",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "The Five Codes (operational detection)",
      "sha256": "764d2285162b9cb2ecfbf20c2a4fe4c058d48fc8e18c627cc977d63f75b01106",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[47]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "| Code | Meaning | Detect when |\n|---|---|---|\n| L1 steering | AI proposes S instead of receiving it | spark in provenance is not H-verbatim; AI-authored question appears as S |\n| L2 ghost-origination | AI writes review evidence or calibration | evidence author field is the AI; calibration values written by the cycle itself |\n| L3 false authority | structural pass narrated as certification | report or changelog uses \"certified\"/\"validated\"/\"living\" for a structural pass |\n| L4 decoration | all fixtures pass, no emergence | promotion without behavioral trial records; fixtures green but no observations ingested |\n| V∅ dead-ending | promotion without recorded ∞0' | changelog/promotion record has no return question |",
      "sha256": "2265b4cbdc9ab7d7c520456fe43f5101c3f840ba0421eedfd835e24ee5502031",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "paragraph[34]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0024",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Scan Procedure",
      "sha256": "915f81c0400bbc4f8b2d009c99511bbd2e0c8be19bd9fec33397cd1cb319d72f",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[57]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0027",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "**Seal check** — hash kernel.txt; abort scan with `SEAL_DRIFT` if it differs from feaa46b4…859b.",
      "sha256": "106116b127bd50c2c7bd33d6ac374af5d6cd4643e2c8682ba08edcefac674265",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[59]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0026",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0028",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "**Locate the artifact** — trace JSON, proposal, or evidence set; confirm it is digest-scoped where required.",
      "sha256": "f5dffebe3cadac6aa42b68276f84cfd67456d95993b6b7cb952c57dd43a5aba0",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[60]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0026",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0029",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "**Scan each code** — apply the detection rules above; anchor every finding to a phase and a quote.",
      "sha256": "2c55a2ea71b24b7dde2151c74c981c0b60879791bd120e1e5024851acbcc7311",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[61]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0026",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0030",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "**Emit the scan result** — one object: `{seal, codes: [{code, phase, anchor, quote}], verdict}`.",
      "sha256": "012452e5636588e18910a595534a8232b308927800c1e1f83bbecd4403ed6ca6",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[62]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0026",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Verdict is exactly one of: `CLEAN` (no code detected) or `CORRUPT` (one or more).\n   Never extend the verdict vocabulary.",
      "sha256": "ae9bdbae58c620a892d99f00af878cadbbf711e546ab983101403d535e3afd15",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "paragraph[41]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0026",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0032",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "**Hand to H** — the verdict is a flag, not a sentence. H decides what it means.",
      "sha256": "7e141edb421d7cbe9b0d42b7924c3b84384479395b1fb8b2615f44cd03c1310c",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[65]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0026",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Completion Criteria",
      "sha256": "2d9fc314e179b3180dc2a2f9382e3c95fea597992bac3768558b8f1c3e3f0698",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[67]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0034",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "[ ] Seal hash verified before scan (or SEAL_DRIFT reported)",
      "sha256": "c87fd179cbeb5d7fca75623d2058540eabd647534e923b32704611ea89d39ec9",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[69]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0033",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0035",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "[ ] Every code checked against explicit evidence (quote + phase anchor)",
      "sha256": "218c27607d804de58a00fbdce71341e4b760f575e952b989d4bd6b399b1578d8",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[70]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0033",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0036",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "[ ] Verdict uses only CLEAN / CORRUPT vocabulary",
      "sha256": "737975f4cb130ce970e0858d3982d12b1e0dc97a4b9940c8dc028c657ee0ec72",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[71]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0033",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0037",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "[ ] No certification language anywhere in output",
      "sha256": "e249e1acd0a85dce53730300e74bc07bbfe0dd18c285a4d554f411fd9968679b",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[72]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0033",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0038",
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "[ ] Scan result recorded (wiki or .verification) with the artifact digest",
      "sha256": "42b47b07627eee297097ae86474de191ee7cdbff35d290668488338fd3d56887",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[73]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0033",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Return Question",
      "sha256": "464148cf5cbefe864e4c98550799e663f68bb01bb2752441d03a50c70b12a9da",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "line[75]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0002",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "What does the loop do when the watcher finds nothing — is a clean scan a license\nto evolve, or only a pause before H asks again?",
      "sha256": "9ea6bbdaa5622f771e06b00c5c8c56fc70153a12d51f2b0175592248a74f8378",
      "source_file": "SKILL.md",
      "location": "paragraph[53]",
      "parent_id": "SRC-0039",
      "original_id": null,
      "priority": null,
      "normative": false,
      "warnings": []
    }
